1088:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         value for HSE crystal.
1089:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           
